  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">I Am Nurtured creates clean, research-backed prenatal and postpartum supplements formulated by Registered Dietitians to provide targeted nutrition for every stage of the motherhood journey—from preconception through postpartum. Unlike traditional one-size-fits-all vitamins, our science-backed formulas combine bioavailable vitamins, minerals, and botanicals to support both mom and baby with exactly what they need, when they need it. Our products are made with high-quality ingredients, are free from artificial additives, and are designed to simplify maternal nutrition with comprehensive, stage-specific support.</p><p>As an I Am Nurtured affiliate, you'll earn a generous 20% commission on every qualifying sale made through your unique referral link or code. Whether you're a healthcare professional, creator, parent, or wellness advocate, you can share products you genuinely believe in while earning meaningful income. Promote I Am Nurtured through social media, blogs, newsletters, podcasts, client recommendations, or your website, and help more families experience better nutrition during pregnancy and postpartum.</p></div>",
